  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      205.58,
      538.23,
      312.53
    ],
    "text": "The low-pressure area located to the East of Sri Lanka, in the Bay of Bengal, has developed into a \u2018Depression\u2019. The system was located approximately 630 km northeast of Trincomalee, slightly East of the Northeast direction by 11:30 a.m. today. It is highly likely that the system will continue to move away from Sri Lanka and intensify into a \u2018Cyclonic Storm\u2019 by the evening of tomorrow (November 16) over the southern and adjacent west-central Bay of Bengal, and further intensify into a \u2018Severe Cyclonic Storm\u2019 over the west-central Bay of Bengal by November 17.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      5.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      317.06,
      538.37,
      410.83
    ],
    "text": "Due to the influence of this system, cloudy skies will prevail over the entire island tomorrow. Several spells of showers will occur in the Northern, North-central, Eastern, Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in the Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      414.61,
      538.37,
      454.39
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in the Uva province and in Hambantota district after 2.00 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      464.14,
      502.79,
      497.95
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      501.61,
      488.69,
      777.36
    ],
    "text": "Misty conditions may prevail in most parts of the island during the early morning hours.",
